---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import PageShell from '../components/PageShell.astro';
---

<Layout 
    title="Terms of Service & User Agreement | Real BMI"
    description="Review the official Terms of Service and user agreement governing access to Real BMI calculators and health tools."
    canonicalURL="https://realbmicalculator.com/terms-conditions/"
>
    <Navbar />
    <PageShell
        title="Terms of Service"
        eyebrow="User agreement & terms"
        description="Terms of service, usage guidelines, and clinical limitations for Real BMI."
        returnUrl="/"
        returnLabel="Home"
    >
        <div class="prose prose-zinc dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-[var(--muted-foreground)] leading-relaxed space-y-10 text-lg md:text-xl font-medium opacity-85">
            <p>
                These Terms govern your access to and use of <span class="text-[var(--foreground)] font-bold">Real BMI</span>, including all calculators, interactive charts, educational content, and software utilities accessible via our website. By accessing or using our platform, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agreed to be bound by these Terms.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">1. Educational Scope & Non-Diagnostic Purpose</h2>
            <p>
                All calculators, assessment scores, and health reference models provided on Real BMI are designed strictly for general educational and personal health awareness. They do not constitute formal medical diagnoses or clinical care plans.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">2. Scientific Formulas & Calculation Accuracy</h2>
            <p>
                Real BMI implements scientifically recognized, peer-reviewed mathematical formulas (WHO, CDC, Mifflin-St Jeor, Devine). While we verify algorithm parity across dual units, statistical estimates cannot replace a licensed physician's evaluation.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">3. Local Browser Processing & Data Privacy</h2>
            <p>
                All personal measurements entered into our calculators are processed purely in client-side JavaScript. We do not transmit, retain, or store individual health parameters on our servers.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">4. Permitted Educational Use</h2>
            <p>
                You are granted a revocable, non-exclusive license for personal educational access. Automated scraping, malicious intrusion, or unauthorized commercial copying is prohibited.
            </p>

            <h2 class="text-2xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-[var(--foreground)]">5. Full Terms & Contact</h2>
            <p>
                To read our complete terms and conditions, visit our <a href="/terms-conditions/" class="text-[var(--accent)] underline font-bold">Comprehensive Terms & Conditions Page</a> or contact our team via the <a href="/contact/" class="text-[var(--accent)] underline font-bold">Contact Desk</a>.
            </p>
        </div>
    </PageShell>
</Layout>
